  "summary": "A paddle dryer is an indirect (contact) dryer. Two hollow shafts with wedge-shaped paddles turn in a jacketed trough; steam inside the jacket, shafts and paddles heats the material, while the paddles mix it and move it towards the outlet. Only a small vapour stream leaves, making it suitable for sludges and pastes.",
